_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-16T15:17:25Z","updated_at":"2025-11-16T15:17:25Z","body":"> Not exactly what I meant when suggesting to turn it into a button with `flat` enabled, but I like the result regardless. Although I don't know if hiding the button on shrink is necessary, since it just has icon-length width.\r\n\r\n@YeldhamDev I accidentally misunderstood the word `besides` to `beside` in `... that you can click it besides the tooltip.` -_-|||\r\nThat's the reason I add a button beside the script name label...Lucky that you like the result regardless.\r\n\r\nThe script_name_label will disappear if the whole bar is very short. Since this button is attached to the script_name_label, it looks a bit odd if the label disappears but the button stays visible. So I make it disappear when space is limited.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3538862294/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3538904686","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112796#issuecomment-3538904686","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112796","id":3538904686,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7S72Zu","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gis